    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Venator Universe, to survive, you must see everyone as a threat while making new friends and watching your back. You need to explore more planets, find more minerals, and earn more. Later, you should go to the space station and trade. This way, you can dominate the server. With a building system featuring nearly 30 parts   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/7416b730923b3f2093c9417f18453a5a.poster.avif?t=1746903981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/7416b730923b3f2093c9417f18453a5a.webm?t=1746903981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/7416b730923b3f2093c9417f18453a5a.mp4?t=1746903981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>With 250 crafting materials, you can either dive into weapon production or dominate the server\u2019s potion supply. There are plenty of products for every profession here. Craft, sell, upgrade, and grow stronger. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/22ff4c78200961797096116fbe5a452e.poster.avif?t=1746903981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/22ff4c78200961797096116fbe5a452e.webm?t=1746903981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/22ff4c78200961797096116fbe5a452e.mp4?t=1746903981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Wouldn't you want to strengthen your home where you store everything? Design it nicely, place things like turrets in strategic spots, or use more primitive creations to make your enemies suffer.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/19fd6f1eb811e1abd84b664997f9e29a.poster.avif?t=1746903981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/19fd6f1eb811e1abd84b664997f9e29a.webm?t=1746903981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/19fd6f1eb811e1abd84b664997f9e29a.mp4?t=1746903981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>With over 200 types of minerals you can gather, become more diverse, stronger, and unique. It's all in your hands. Travel, explore, overcome dangers, and acquire them.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/208599fd804bef339be7b193e430b655.poster.avif?t=1746903981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/208599fd804bef339be7b193e430b655.webm?t=1746903981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/208599fd804bef339be7b193e430b655.mp4?t=1746903981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Not just trees and crystals. Of course, you can also discover minerals, food, or surprise ancient items from the soil. Keep your eyes open\u2014every place is equally rich in resources. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/acfee28378d7f84b665eb559062c0960.poster.avif?t=1746903981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/acfee28378d7f84b665eb559062c0960.webm?t=1746903981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/acfee28378d7f84b665eb559062c0960.mp4?t=1746903981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Fishing is a trade source on its own. Eat and boost your basic resources, cook and sell meals, dry them and prepare special mixtures, or hope for a relic to appear on the end of your line. The choice is yours. Define your playstyle.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/231b3add2a65f8794ba92eb32cfba95e.poster.avif?t=1746903981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/231b3add2a65f8794ba92eb32cfba95e.webm?t=1746903981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/231b3add2a65f8794ba92eb32cfba95e.mp4?t=1746903981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>To survive, you need to crush your rivals. Everyone is an enemy, so craft your melee or ranged weapon. Remember, all of them are upgradeable items. Be patient and try upgrading.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/81a77313e8ef2b94e1e0b26c4a000dcb.poster.avif?t=1746903981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/81a77313e8ef2b94e1e0b26c4a000dcb.webm?t=1746903981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/81a77313e8ef2b94e1e0b26c4a000dcb.mp4?t=1746903981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Now, take the loot you\u2019ve gathered or stolen from someone else and quickly bring it to the space station. There, you can sell it at a good price, and maybe find something even better through bargaining. Or, you can wait for the black market that appears at night. You can try your luck for many items that aren't produced in the game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/a22a76dddae7df9a6e497c86d30a4fe9.poster.avif?t=1746903981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/a22a76dddae7df9a6e497c86d30a4fe9.webm?t=1746903981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/a22a76dddae7df9a6e497c86d30a4fe9.mp4?t=1746903981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Venator Universe, to survive, you must see everyone as a threat while making new friends and watching your back. You need to explore more planets, find more minerals, and earn more. Later, you should go to the space station and trade. This way, you can dominate the server. With a building system featuring nearly 30 parts   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/7416b730923b3f2093c9417f18453a5a.poster.avif?t=1746903981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/7416b730923b3f2093c9417f18453a5a.webm?t=1746903981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/7416b730923b3f2093c9417f18453a5a.mp4?t=1746903981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>With 250 crafting materials, you can either dive into weapon production or dominate the server\u2019s potion supply. There are plenty of products for every profession here. Craft, sell, upgrade, and grow stronger. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/22ff4c78200961797096116fbe5a452e.poster.avif?t=1746903981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/22ff4c78200961797096116fbe5a452e.webm?t=1746903981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/22ff4c78200961797096116fbe5a452e.mp4?t=1746903981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Wouldn't you want to strengthen your home where you store everything? Design it nicely, place things like turrets in strategic spots, or use more primitive creations to make your enemies suffer.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/19fd6f1eb811e1abd84b664997f9e29a.poster.avif?t=1746903981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/19fd6f1eb811e1abd84b664997f9e29a.webm?t=1746903981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/19fd6f1eb811e1abd84b664997f9e29a.mp4?t=1746903981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>With over 200 types of minerals you can gather, become more diverse, stronger, and unique. It's all in your hands. Travel, explore, overcome dangers, and acquire them.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/208599fd804bef339be7b193e430b655.poster.avif?t=1746903981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/208599fd804bef339be7b193e430b655.webm?t=1746903981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/208599fd804bef339be7b193e430b655.mp4?t=1746903981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Not just trees and crystals. Of course, you can also discover minerals, food, or surprise ancient items from the soil. Keep your eyes open\u2014every place is equally rich in resources. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/acfee28378d7f84b665eb559062c0960.poster.avif?t=1746903981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/acfee28378d7f84b665eb559062c0960.webm?t=1746903981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/acfee28378d7f84b665eb559062c0960.mp4?t=1746903981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Fishing is a trade source on its own. Eat and boost your basic resources, cook and sell meals, dry them and prepare special mixtures, or hope for a relic to appear on the end of your line. The choice is yours. Define your playstyle.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/231b3add2a65f8794ba92eb32cfba95e.poster.avif?t=1746903981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/231b3add2a65f8794ba92eb32cfba95e.webm?t=1746903981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/231b3add2a65f8794ba92eb32cfba95e.mp4?t=1746903981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>To survive, you need to crush your rivals. Everyone is an enemy, so craft your melee or ranged weapon. Remember, all of them are upgradeable items. Be patient and try upgrading.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/81a77313e8ef2b94e1e0b26c4a000dcb.poster.avif?t=1746903981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/81a77313e8ef2b94e1e0b26c4a000dcb.webm?t=1746903981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/81a77313e8ef2b94e1e0b26c4a000dcb.mp4?t=1746903981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Now, take the loot you\u2019ve gathered or stolen from someone else and quickly bring it to the space station. There, you can sell it at a good price, and maybe find something even better through bargaining. Or, you can wait for the black market that appears at night. You can try your luck for many items that aren't produced in the game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/a22a76dddae7df9a6e497c86d30a4fe9.poster.avif?t=1746903981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/a22a76dddae7df9a6e497c86d30a4fe9.webm?t=1746903981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489900/extras/a22a76dddae7df9a6e497c86d30a4fe9.mp4?t=1746903981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
